OL,3,CRichmond 'smash-and-grab' jewel
OL,4,Cthieves jailed
OL,6,FThe brazen, masked, "smash-and-grab"
OL,7,Frobbers, who broke the window of a
OL,8,Fjewellers in broad daylight and made
OL,9,Foff with more than #200,000 worth of
OL,10,Fjewels, have been jailed.
OL,12,FDeniz Mehmet, 28, Robert Clarke, 50,
OL,13,Fand Lee Ramsey, 46, all of Essex, were
OL,14,Farrested on suspicion of conspiracy to
OL,15,Fcommit robbery after a sledgehammer
OL,16,Fwas used to break the window at the
OL,17,Fshop in Paved Court, Richmond, south-
OL,18,Fwest London, on January 31.
OL,26,@nD@UOUnD@dO]
