OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1785761308
OL,3,CRichmond 'smash-and-grab' jewel
OL,4,Cthieves jailed
OL,6,FThe robbers made off with #225,000
OL,7,Fworth of jewels, the Metropolitan
OL,8,FPolice said.
OL,10,FDuring a sentencing hearing at
OL,11,FKingston Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,12,FMehmet, of Elham Drive, Basildon, was
OL,13,Fjailed for five years; Clarke, of
OL,14,FLever Lane, Rochford, was jailed for
OL,15,Fsix years and six months; and Ramsey,
OL,16,Fof Hastingwood Road, Harlow, was
OL,17,Fjailed for five years and three
OL,18,Fmonths, court staff said.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/6
