OL,3,CRichmond 'smash-and-grab' jewel
OL,4,Cthieves jailed
OL,6,FA month after the robbery, the first
OL,7,Ftwo were arrested in their homes as
OL,8,Fthey slept in their beds. First was
OL,9,FLee Ramsey and second, Robert Clarke.
OL,11,FA few weeks later officers tracked
OL,12,Fdown the third - Deniz Mehmet - and
OL,13,Farrested him on the street.
OL,15,FThey had all pleaded guilty to the
OL,16,Foffence.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
