CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F377A1785761308
OL,3,CRichmond 'smash-and-grab' jewel
OL,4,Cthieves jailed
OL,6,FFurther footage released by the Met
OL,7,Fshows officers bursting into the
OL,8,Fbedrooms of Clarke and Ramsey to
OL,9,Farrest them during the early hours of
OL,10,FMarch 31.
OL,12,FMehmet was seen being detained on a
OL,13,Fstreet on April 8.
OL,15,FThey were caught after officers looked
OL,16,Fat CCTV footage, carried out forensic
OL,17,Fanalysis and recovered a vehicle
OL,18,Fbelieved to be linked to the robbery.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/6
