OL,3,CRichmond 'smash-and-grab' jewel
OL,4,Cthieves jailed
OL,6,FDetective Superintendent Dan Mitchell,
OL,7,Ffrom the Met's Flying Squad, said:
OL,8,F"Robberies of this kind cause real
OL,9,Fconcern for residents and businesses
OL,10,Fin the communities that are targeted.
OL,11,FIt's they who feel the immediate
OL,12,Fimpact.
OL,14,F"These sentences mark a significant
OL,15,Fstep in what has been a detailed and
OL,16,Fdetermined investigation. I hope they
OL,17,Fdemonstrate our commitment to tackling
OL,18,Fsmashandgrab robberies in London by
OL,19,Fgoing after those involved, wherever
OL,20,Fthey are.
OL,26,@pD@AOUvD@AOU
